        <mxCell id="dep-pg" value="&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;source of truth" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#059669;fontSize=12;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="760" width="180" height="60" as="geometry" />
